     "html": "<strong>A chip is in het Verenigd Koninkrijk een frietje</strong>, zoals in <em>fish and chips</em>. In de Verenigde Staten is <em>a chip</em> net een chipje uit een zakje, en heet een frietje <em>a French fry</em>. Eén woord, twee borden."
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Engels</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Nederlands</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">to <strong>get on well with someone</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">goed met iemand <strong>overeenkomen</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">to be <strong>fed up with something</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">er <strong>genoeg</strong> van hebben</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">to have a <strong>lie-in</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>uitslapen</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">to <strong>do the washing-up</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>afwassen</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">to <strong>tidy up</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>opruimen</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">to <strong>move house</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>verhuizen</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a <strong>hobby</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een <strong>vrijetijdsbesteding</strong></td></tr></table>"
